# Environment variable reference separating Netlify frontend variables from Cloudflare backend variables and secrets [Commented by: Google AI Studio on 17/10/2026 03:22 AM]

# ==============================================================================
# 1. FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Configure in Netlify Site Settings)
# Path in Netlify: Site configuration -> Environment variables -> Add a variable
# ==============================================================================

# [REQUIRED] Supabase Project URL
# Your production Supabase URL: https://kyluvwlbdtovuwpmakep.supabase.co
# Found in: Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API -> Project URL
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://kyluvwlbdtovuwpmakep.supabase.co"

# [REQUIRED] Supabase Anon / Public Key (JWT token starting with eyJhbGciOi...)
# Safe for browser distribution; restricted by Supabase Row Level Security (RLS)
# Found in: Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API -> Project API Keys -> anon / public
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-supabase-anon-key-here"

# [REQUIRED] Cloudflare Worker Backend API URL
# Your deployed Worker URL: https://nanobot-api.mud-amiable-tweed.workers.dev
# Handled with built-in default fallback in workerClient.ts, but recommend explicit setting in Netlify
VITE_CLOUDFLARE_WORKER_URL="https://nanobot-api.mud-amiable-tweed.workers.dev"

# Removed obsolete VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY and VITE_TAVILY_API_KEY variables per BYOK policy [Commented by: Google AI Studio on 18/10/2026 12:50 PM]

# ==============================================================================
# 2. BACKEND WORKER CONFIGURATION (Cloudflare Worker nanobot-api)
# Non-secret variables (CORS_ORIGIN, SUPABASE_URL) are configured in worker/wrangler.toml.
# Secret keys (SUPABASE_ANON_KEY) are configured via Cloudflare Dashboard or Wrangler CLI.
# Path in Cloudflare: Workers & Pages -> nanobot-api -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets
# Or via CLI: npx wrangler secret put SUPABASE_ANON_KEY inside /worker directory
# ==============================================================================
# [Non-secret variable in wrangler.toml [vars]]:
# CORS_ORIGIN="https://nanobot-chatbot.netlify.app"
# SUPABASE_URL="https://kyluvwlbdtovuwpmakep.supabase.co"
#
# [Encrypted secret in Cloudflare Dashboard / CLI]:
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-supabase-anon-key-here"
# [REQUIRED Dedicated Server-Side MCP Credential Encryption Secret in Cloudflare Dashboard / CLI]:
# Configure via CLI: npx wrangler secret put MCP_ENCRYPTION_SECRET
MCP_ENCRYPTION_SECRET="your-dedicated-aes-gcm-encryption-secret" # [Commented by: Google AI Studio on 31/10/2026 11:05 AM]


# ==============================================================================
# 3. GITHUB ACTIONS DEPLOYMENT SECRETS (Configure in GitHub Repository)
# DO NOT commit tokens to git!
# Path in GitHub: Repo Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> New repository secret
# ==============================================================================
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN="your-cloudflare-api-token-with-worker-edit-permission"
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID="your-cloudflare-account-id"
